error[R0607] (conservative): comparison with a table constructor
--> 11:9: always false — the constructor makes a fresh table
  = note: `==` on tables compares identity, and a just-constructed table is never the same object; to test for emptiness use `next(t) == nil`, to compare contents compare fields
  = note: an `__eq` metamethod on the other operand could make this meaningful; none is visible here
